node_modules/

# Cargo config (optional)
# .cargo/

# Downloaded reference docs
api.md
module_breakdown.md

# Download test output
/downloads/

# Test data (bridge integration tests)
/test_data/

# Download queue state (generated at runtime)
**/.queue_state.json

